OL,3,GNEWSALove, luck and magic: Why are
OL,4,Ayoung people turning to online witches?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLove or luck, take your pick. All yours
OL,7,Fwith a simple click.
OL,9,FOr at least that's the promise being
OL,10,Fmade by so-called "Etsy witches", who
OL,11,Fclaim to cast spells for everything
OL,12,Ffrom good fortune to good weather.
OL,14,FAnd it seems there's a growing appetite
OL,15,Ffor a little magic. Online retailer
OL,16,FEtsy says searches for weather spells
OL,17,Fand witches have significantly
OL,18,Fincreased this year.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
